     A                                  1 25'AUTOMATIC mode ENTER HOURS'
     A                                  3  6'Press f4 (MANUAL) if you want the'
     A                                  3 40'program to manually enter hours.'
     A                                  4  1'In manual mode the only hours adde-
     A                                      d to the file are the hours that yo-
     A                                      u'
     A                                  5  1'manually enter.  In automatic mode'
     A                                  5 36'(hours worked) if you don"t enter'
     A                                  5 70'8 hours'
     A                                  6  1'for an employee the program will c-
     A                                      harge them hours for that day to ma-
     A                                      ke a total'
     A                                  7  1'of 8 hours.  In automatic mode (ho-
     A                                      urs refused) if you don"t charge an-
     A                                       employee'
     A                                  8  1'with 8 hours refused the program w-
     A                                      ill credit them with hours worked'
     A                                  8 69'to total'
     A                                  9  1'8 hours for that day.'
     A                                 10  6'You may enter a Department number,'
     A                                 10 41'Classification and Shift to start'
     A                                 11  1'entering hours at a selected work'
     A                                 11 35'group.  If you do not enter a depa-
     A                                      rtment'
     A                                 12  1'number the program will start with'
     A                                 12 36'the first work group in your divis-
     A                                      ion and'
     A                                 13  1'sequentially step through your div-
     A                                      ision.'
     A                                 15  6'You may use f7 to go to the FINISH'
     A                                 15 41'HOURS instruction screen.  It will'
     A                                 16  1'allow you to automatically update'
     A                                 16 35'your entire division without havin-
     A                                      g to'
     A                                 17  1'view all the records yourself.'
