     A                                      or the division back to zero.  You'
     A                                  2 11'must have had a division printout'
     A                                  2 45'since the last file update'
     A                                  3 11'or the file will not reset.'
     A                                  5  1'f2 - Will reset total hours back t-
     A                                      o zero.  (This affects total hours'
     A                                  5 70'only.)'
     A                                  6 11'However, this function is only all-
     A                                      owed at the end of the year.'
     A                                  8  1'f8 - To change or set a weekending'
