     A                                  1 29'ASSIGN USERS ACCESS'
     A                                  4  6'This routine allows you to control'
     A                                  4 41'which functions of the balance of'
     A                                  5  1'hours program that another user in'
     A                                  5 36'your division may have access to.'
     A                                  5 71'First'
     A                                  6  1'you should contact the data proces-
     A                                      sing center manager and establish'
     A                                  6 69'a new'
     A                                  7  1'"username" then type that username'
     A                                  7 36'in the space below and press f1 to'
     A                                  7 71'add'
     A                                  8  1'the new user to the file.  You wil-
     A                                      l then be presented with a screen'
     A                                  8 69'to allow'
     A                                  9  1'you to choose which functions you'
     A                                  9 35'want that user to be able to acces-
     A                                      s.'
