     A                                  1 30'VOLUNTEER STATUS'
     A                                  5  1'Use f1 to toggle between types of'
     A                                  5 35'volunteer status (ie. DOT, SAT, SU-
     A                                      N or HOL).'
     A                                  7  1'Use f4 to reset status of all empl-
     A                                      oyees to non-volunteer for the type-
     A                                       of'
     A                                  8  1'volunteer status currently being d-
     A                                      isplayed.'
     A                                 10  1'You may enter a department, classi-
     A                                      fication and shift to start at a pa-
     A                                      rticular'
     A                                 11  1'work group or leave them blank to'
     A                                 11 35'start at the beginning of your div-
     A                                      ision'
     A                                 12  1'file.  Press f6 to see employee"s'
     A                                 12 35'names and volunteer status.  To ch-
     A                                      ange an'
     A                                 13  1'employee"s status, place an X in t-
     A                                      he box if they are a volunteer or'
     A                                 13 69'leave it'
     A                                 14  1'blank if they are not a volunteer,'
     A                                 14 36'then press ENTER.  Only the ENTER'
     A                                 14 70'key on'
     A                                 15  1'the form screen will affect a chan-
     A                                      ge. Use f1 to change the type of st-
     A                                      atus,'
     A                                 16  1'f6 to see the next workgroup, f7 t-
     A                                      o come back to this screen or f3 to-
     A                                       go to'
     A                                 17  1'the Main Menu.'
